0 436 359 [
[(The "band limit" controls how fast the transition table is)]
[(read. If it is set to the Nyquist frequency the table is)]
[(read at 0.4 times the Nyquist, or five samples a cycle.)]
[(Lowering the band limit cuts off the partials of the)]
[(generated sawtooth wave at frequencies below the Nyquist.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
